ease` compiles clean with no warnings. Nothing in `c_src/` was modified — the only files written are `translation/Cargo.toml`, `translation/Cargo.lock`, and `translation/src/main.rs`.\n\nOne caveat on the scope of this check: the program reads no stdin and takes no arguments (`argc`/`argv` are unused in the C), so its output is a single fixed string. The byte-comparison above is therefore an exhaustive test of the program's behavior rather than a sample — but that strength comes from the program's triviality, not from thorough test design."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_read_input_tokens":16682,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":306,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8b9e7c1-3f0f-4c80-88bc-2b9b718b246a","uuid":"d87bd911-e100-49c0-8e4d-030f854a3d6b","timestamp":"2026-08-28T12:10:59.534Z"}
